<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean meal major sales activity in the week ended Oct 24 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1996/97		 1997/98</p>
<p> Philippines    53,500		  Nil</p>
<p> S Korea	  49,600</p>
<p> Unknown	  39,500</p>
<p> Italy	    35,000</p>
<p> S Africa	 35,000</p>
<p> China	   -54,500</p>
<p>Net sales of 242,900 tonnes were 25 percent below the previous week.</p>
<p>Exports of 168,400 tonnes were 95 percent higher than the previous week and almost three times the four-week average.</p>
<p>Major export destinations were South Korea (49,600), Saudi Arabia (46,600) and China (27,500).</p>
</text>
